{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00328",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 6.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Doctor, this one's ready for you. Everything's on the chart, but I'll go through it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.45,
      "end_seconds": 11.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Thank you. Good morning, tell me what's been going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.89,
      "end_seconds": 21.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "Honestly, uh, it's blood on the toilet paper, and my family pushed me to come. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.41,
      "end_seconds": 24.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Alright, when did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.14,
      "end_seconds": 30.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "About... well, two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.37,
      "end_seconds": 35.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.47,
      "end_seconds": 37.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.66,
      "end_seconds": 41.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Right, have you had an itchy bottom?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.1,
      "end_seconds": 48.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "Yeah, that too. Okay, so about itchy bottom, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.46,
      "end_seconds": 52.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Have you had pain when you pass stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.88,
      "end_seconds": 57.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Yes, you know, about the same, about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.35,
      "end_seconds": 62.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.11,
      "end_seconds": 63.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.82,
      "end_seconds": 82.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let me check a few things. Any black stools or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.42,
      "end_seconds": 87.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Um, no, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.17,
      "end_seconds": 92.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Any abdominal pain, change in bowel habit or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.91,
      "end_seconds": 95.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.17,
      "end_seconds": 108.36,
      "duration_seconds": 11.19,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.32,
      "end_seconds": 111.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.33,
      "end_seconds": 115.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.26,
      "end_seconds": 124.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "I take iron tablets, once a day for my blood count. Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.37,
      "end_seconds": 127.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.52,
      "end_seconds": 129.27,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.64,
      "end_seconds": 151.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.62,
      "end_seconds": 158.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "I have low haemoglobin. It's the not knowing that gets to me. Diabetes, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.56,
      "end_seconds": 172.99,
      "duration_seconds": 13.43,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the low haemoglobin in your file as well. Yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well. So, do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.03,
      "end_seconds": 186.8,
      "duration_seconds": 12.77,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.53,
      "end_seconds": 189.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.51,
      "end_seconds": 194.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.75,
      "end_seconds": 211.05,
      "duration_seconds": 15.3,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.86,
      "end_seconds": 213.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 215.5,
      "end_seconds": 221.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Blood pressure 125 over 79, heart rate 83, temp 36.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.33,
      "end_seconds": 224.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Thanks. How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.32,
      "end_seconds": 231.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.57,
      "end_seconds": 237.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Alright, I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.05,
      "end_seconds": 241.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.56,
      "end_seconds": 253.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Tummy is soft and non-tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.24,
      "end_seconds": 279.35,
      "duration_seconds": 24.11,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.75,
      "end_seconds": 282.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.81,
      "end_seconds": 296.87,
      "duration_seconds": 14.06,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with haemorrhoids at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. It could also be an anal fissure, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.35,
      "end_seconds": 303.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "I've, I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.33,
      "end_seconds": 321.86,
      "duration_seconds": 17.53,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like haemorrhoids, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had blood on the toilet paper for two days, severe, and no weight loss or black stools."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.17,
      "end_seconds": 324.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.85,
      "end_seconds": 329.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.9,
      "end_seconds": 331.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.49,
      "end_seconds": 341.51,
      "duration_seconds": 9.02,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood tests, for rectal bleeding. Let's use lactulose, 15 ml, at night, for two weeks. You take it by mouth. That's for constipation."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.45,
      "end_seconds": 344.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.99,
      "end_seconds": 354.48,
      "duration_seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "Let's use a soothing cream, twice a day, for one week. That's for haemorrhoids. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.48,
      "end_seconds": 357.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.99,
      "end_seconds": 386.07,
      "duration_seconds": 27.08,
      "text": "Soak in a warm bath for ten minutes after you pass stool, and don't strain. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. I'd like you to see a colorectal surgeon as well, and I'll write the referral. Keep an eye out, and if you pass a lot of blood or feel faint, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.0,
      "end_seconds": 391.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Come back in three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.61,
      "end_seconds": 394.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.76,
      "end_seconds": 400.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.71,
      "end_seconds": 407.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "So, I take the lactulose, 15 ml, at night. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 407.78,
      "end_seconds": 411.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.15,
      "end_seconds": 417.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Um, that's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.7,
      "end_seconds": 420.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}